Package: simling
Title: Simulated Linguistic Data for Teaching Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Massimiliano", "Canzi", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "massimiliano.canzi@uni-konstanz.de",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6124-0321"))
Description: Simulated data sets for teaching statistics to linguists, from
    phonetics, psycholinguistics, syntax, semantics and pragmatics, corpus
    linguistics, sociolinguistics, language acquisition, historical
    linguistics and typology. Responses include continuous measures, binary
    and multi-category outcomes, ratings, counts, eye-tracking measures and
    time series, in data sets from 18 to over 20,000 rows. Each data set comes
    with the code that generated it, so the true effects are known.
